{"v":4,"catch":"打開它，驚喜玩具盒！","desc":"《TOY POP》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1986年發行的動作遊戲。\n您控制從玩具箱中彈出的 PINO 和 ACHA，並收集隱藏在盒子（舞台）中的心來打開門並前進。 使用隱藏在盒子中的更改目標來更換武器並擊敗敵人。 在最後一個盒子裡擊敗女巫，拯救玩具樂園。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如游戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-10-13","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8beea4ce03a59e4941920ec6e35e8b4633018b08bac7702d40197058cb9b8baa.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/86c36d09f7c49b024120c5e2ab7b731ab0426a09daddc30ea9d800f099229fe7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/12950419e59f5de20a69d4c77a3e090d8cab780ce5c7e5c0c4ae1527b83606a9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/241fa95c770183f88f390554ca1a283db2bd05e0450ce3bbacbd705b92584bb3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a2b4002ac307cec8847884671820aacac6998896ec6e873a237b047ab75abf98.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/329fe3dbe2b07a7c5d1e72a635ac5c423a5237d6e147bf468d435fa44b02ea97.jpg"],"titleId":"0100e40018b6a000","dlc":[]}